meta {
  name: run-analysis pre-flight
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/analyze/engine
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  What one run-analysis call would use: {available,provider,model,address} or {available:false,reason,provider,detail?} with reasons provider-is-local | needs-key. The consent dialog's truth, so no button can fail (card 294).
  
  Fence: host+origin — Loopback fence plus Origin check: an Origin header, if present, must be loopback. REST clients send no Origin header, which counts as safe — requests pass. A manually added foreign Origin answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: no
}
